 113:./ucos/Core/os_tmr.c **** *                               OS_ERR_TMR_NON_AVAIL            if there are no free timers from th
 114:./ucos/Core/os_tmr.c **** *
 115:./ucos/Core/os_tmr.c **** * Returns    : A pointer to an OS_TMR data structure.
